WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,620
You two are so early, General.

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,620
Be careful

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:10,780
But don't fall in there.

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,780
Mr. Fan

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,780
Why is there no movement?

6
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:15,780
Could it be that he also fell into the hair pit? That's nonsense.

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,780
You thought it was you

8
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:17,780
you don't know

9
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,780
