10
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,780
Sorry to ask for help

11
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,780
I'll go in and have a look

12
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,780
my great general

13
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,780
Just don’t fall down, Liu San

14
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:25,780
I think you're hungry?

15
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,990
