29
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:02,540
Five hundred dollars at most

30
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,540
Moving things, right? I'll move them

31
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:07,430
I charge you four hundred

32
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:08,430
Yes, yes, me
